---
import BGCopyButton from "./copy-button.astro";

const sample = `// one grid, two families
import { render, surface } from "pocketjs";

export function counter() {
  const label = () => \`点了 \${count.value} 次\`;   // 中英混排，字距稳定
  return button("加一", { onPress: () => count.value++ });
}`;
---

<section id="text" class="scroll-mt-24 py-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-[min(1180px,100%-2.5rem)] max-[760px]:w-[min(1180px,100%-1.75rem)] transition-[opacity,translate] duration-700 [.js_&]:translate-y-4 [.js_&]:opacity-0 [.js_&.in]:translate-y-0 [.js_&.in]:opacity-100" data-reveal>
    <div class="mb-[1.6rem] max-w-[62ch]">
      <p class="my-[1em] max-w-[68ch] inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.16em] text-bf-fg-muted uppercase before:size-[6px] before:rounded-full before:bg-bf-blue before:shadow-[0_0_0_4px_color-mix(in_srgb,var(--bf-blue)_16%,transparent)] before:content-['']">
        05 — Running text
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 mb-[0.7rem] text-[clamp(1.7rem,3.2vw,2.4rem)] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.025em] text-balance">Prose next to code</h2>
      <p class="my-[1em] max-w-[56ch] text-[clamp(1.05rem,1.7vw,1.3rem)] text-foreground/75">
        The same hanzi serve both families. Body copy goes to Qu Black Sans; anything the reader has
        to compare character by character stays in Qu Black Mono.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 min-[900px]:grid-cols-2" data-two-column>
      <div class="rounded-[18px] border border-bf-border bg-bf-border-muted/70 p-[clamp(1.1rem,2.5vw,1.7rem)]" data-specimen>
        <p class="max-w-[68ch] m-0 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.78]">
          编译产物不是「打包好的 CSS + compiled JS + 一个 HTML」，而是一个
          <code class="font-mono text-[0.95em] border border-bf-border bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--bf-border)_8%,transparent)] px-[0.1em] py-[0.04em] rounded-[6px] [font-variation-settings:'MONO'_1,'CASL'_0,'CRSV'_0.5] text-bf-yellow">app.js</code> 加一个二进制的
          <code class="font-mono text-[0.95em] border border-bf-border bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--bf-border)_8%,transparent)] px-[0.1em] py-[0.04em] rounded-[6px] [font-variation-settings:'MONO'_1,'CASL'_0,'CRSV'_0.5] text-bf-yellow">app.pak</code>。TSX 走 MicroTS 编到 JS，交给 QuickJS
          执行；Tailwind 的类名在构建期换成二进制样式表，运行时只查表。
        </p>
        <p class="max-w-[68ch] mt-4 mb-0 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.78]">
          Typesetting note: Chinese line height should not copy Latin's 1.5 — 1.78 reads better, and
          identifiers such as <code class="font-mono text-[0.95em] border border-bf-border bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--bf-border)_8%,transparent)] px-[0.1em] py-[0.04em] rounded-[6px] [font-variation-settings:'MONO'_1,'CASL'_0,'CRSV'_0.5] text-bf-yellow">className</code> or
          <code class="font-mono text-[0.95em] border border-bf-border bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--bf-border)_8%,transparent)] px-[0.1em] py-[0.04em] rounded-[6px] [font-variation-settings:'MONO'_1,'CASL'_0,'CRSV'_0.5] text-bf-yellow">web-compat</code> must stay in the mono family, or
          <code class="font-mono text-[0.95em] border border-bf-border bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--bf-border)_8%,transparent)] px-[0.1em] py-[0.04em] rounded-[6px] [font-variation-settings:'MONO'_1,'CASL'_0,'CRSV'_0.5] text-bf-yellow">i</code> and
          <code class="font-mono text-[0.95em] border border-bf-border bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--bf-border)_8%,transparent)] px-[0.1em] py-[0.04em] rounded-[6px] [font-variation-settings:'MONO'_1,'CASL'_0,'CRSV'_0.5] text-bf-yellow">l</code> collapse into each other.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[18px] border border-bf-border bg-bf-border-muted/85">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-3 pt-2 pb-2 font-mono text-[0.7rem]">
          <span class="text-bf-dim">counter.tsx</span>
          <BGCopyButton value={sample} />
        </div>
        <pre class="m-0 overflow-x-auto rounded-[10px] border border-bf-border bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--bf-border-muted)_72%,transparent)] p-3 font-mono text-[0.82rem] leading-[1.7] [font-variation-settings:'MONO'_1,'CASL'_0,'CRSV'_0.5]"><code>{sample}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
